    "original_gold_lex_dicts": {
        "Id1": {
            "text": "Est\u00e1dio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca is a sports ground which is based in Arapiraca and used by the team Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense. Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense played in the 2015 season of the Brazil based Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league. Vila Nova Futebol Clube have been previous champions of the Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "In 2015, Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense, whose ground is the Estadio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca in Arapiraca, played in the Brazilian-based Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league. Vila Nova Futebol Clube are the champions of Campeonato Brasileiro Serie C."
        },
        "Id3": {
            "text": "The Vila Nova Futebol Clube were champions at the Campeonato Brasileiro Serie C from Brazil. Agremiacao Sportiva Arapiraquense also played there in the 2015 season; their ground is Estadio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca located in Arapiraca."
        }
    },
